hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1320","It was narrated to me by Abdah bin Abdullah Al-Khuza’i, it was by Zaid, meaning Ibn al-Hubab, it was narrated to me by Muhammad bin Dirham, it was narrated to me by Ka’b bin Abd al-Rahman. Al-Ansari, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abu Qatada, said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, came to a group of Ansar who were building a mosque. So He said to them: “Enlarge it and you will fill it.”"
